    {
      "Original": "About",
      "Context": "UI.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiEx.EzTabBar",
      "Translated": "关于",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Actions that are not technically casts but can be interrupted or stopped early due to movement of any kind.",
      "Context": "UI.Extras",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "部分技能无需咏唱，但移动会提前中断或停止技能效果。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "All",
      "Context": "UI.Jobs",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Button",
      "Translated": "全部",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Allows emergency movement via holding down MB1 and MB2 simultaneously.",
      "Context": "UI.Settings",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "同时按住鼠标左右键可以紧急移动。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Allows use when in PvP game modes such as Frontlines and Crystaline Conflict.\n\nThis is considered an unfair advantage over other players so use at your own risk (and conscious).",
      "Context": "UI.Extras",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "允许在纷争前线和水晶冲突等 PvP 模式中使用。\n\n作者认为这会使你相对其他玩家取得不公平的优势，请自行权衡使用风险。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
